{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本防災廳今（2日）正式成立，由首相高市早苗擔任主任大臣（即部門首長/一把手），統管業務的第一任防災大臣則由復興大臣細野豪志兼任。</p><p>防災廳負責統籌跨部門災害對策，重點應對南海海槽大地震及首都直下型地震等「國難級」災害。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:21:11.856243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:58:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.797546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.804598+00:00","content_hash":"9027ec398c3fa082e341ed6c8f65ffb6f29800492c5a6a1510e55fce5177a629","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}